-- DataLab · 017 · the hacker collection
-- The shop (assets/js/cosmetics.js) now sells: 8 hacker skins (shirt slot), 8 accessories by body
-- position (slots head / face / neck / back / hands) and 5 pets (slot pet, one at a time). The three
-- emotes are free and live only in the client: nothing to store.
-- Retired (no longer sold or kept): every infrastructure skin, the basic clothes, hairstyles, hats,
-- the old accessories, the palettes, the golden items and seven older costumes. Whoever bought them
-- gets the price back in Gold, once, here; whoever was wearing a retired skin gets the first new skin
-- (Moletom do Código) equipped in its place. Their rows stay in public.items (inactive, not for sale):
-- the ledger points at them. Equipping the new slots needs no change (private.inventory_equip takes any
-- slot; the client draws the accessories and the pet from equipped_items). The Edge Function
-- "inventory" accepts the new slots for unequip (supabase/functions/inventory/index.ts).
begin;

